@host = http://localhost:5268

### Service document
GET {{host}}/odata

### Metadata
GET {{host}}/odata/$metadata

### Demo paging config (dataset 5000, page size 500)
GET {{host}}/demo/config

### First server page (500 rows + @odata.nextLink)
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$count=true&$orderby=Id
OData-Version: 4.0

### Second server page
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$count=true&$orderby=Id&$skip=500
OData-Version: 4.0

### Synchronous query (waits QueryDelayMilliseconds per page)
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$filter=Price lt 50&$select=Id,Name,Price,Category
OData-Version: 4.0

### Long-running query via HTTP 202
# Poll the Location URL from the 202 response until it returns 200 + AsyncResult.
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$filter=contains(Name,'Queso')&$orderby=Price
Prefer: respond-async
OData-Version: 4.0

### Async with wait=2 and 4000ms page delay — 202 then poll Location
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$count=true&$orderby=Id
Prefer: respond-async, wait=2
X-Demo-Wait-Delay-Milliseconds: 4000
OData-Version: 4.0

### Async with wait=10 and 4000ms page delay — 200 on this request
GET {{host}}/odata/Products?$count=true&$orderby=Id
Prefer: respond-async, wait=10
X-Demo-Wait-Delay-Milliseconds: 4000
OData-Version: 4.0

### Single entity, async
GET {{host}}/odata/Products(3)
Prefer: respond-async

### Poll a job (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/async/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Poll wrapped as application/http (OData 4.0 style)
GET {{host}}/async/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/http

### Cancel a running job
DELETE {{host}}/async/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
